/T (Following the dataset and guideline from Excel Expert Preparation course by Maven Analytics taken in Udemy, I analyzed a dataset involving 6,000 Airbnb listings, where advanced  Microsoft Excel concepts to determine the investment potential of one property in NYC. I used Excel functions and formulas to conduct customer behavior assessment, potential profit prediction, and property competitiveness evaluation in order to generate insights that lead to an informed investment decision )
